  "prefLabel": "Spe 403.04 Reinstatement of Licenses Lapsed For Longer Than 70 Days But No More Than Two Years",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Spe 403.04 Reinstatement of Licenses Lapsed For Longer Than 70 Days But No More Than Two Years. The board shall reinstate a license lapsed longer than 70 days but no more than 2 years if the reinstatement applicant submits to the board:\n\n(a) All documents as described in Spe 403.03;\n\n(b) A resume as described in Spe 403.07(f);\n\n(c) A criminal offender record report described in Spe 403.07(i); and\n\n(d) Letters of verification as described in Spe 403.07(g).\n\nSource. #9406, eff 3-7-09; ss by #9648, eff 1-29-10; ss by #9708, eff 5-8-10; ss by #9883-A, eff 3-5-11 (from Spe 403.03); ss by #10683, eff 10-4-14; ss by #10907, eff 8-7-15",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/spe100-600.html"
